<gpx version="1.1" creator="TerraTrack" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<wpt lat="38.544395" lon="-106.926935"><name>Coffee: Gunnison</name><desc>Mile 0. Gunnison Coffee Company, 910 W New York, 6 to 6 (weekends 7 to 5); The Coffee Trader, 700 N Main, 970-707-4284. Map data, not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.552915" lon="-106.926896"><name>Fuel: City Market, N Main</name><desc>Mile 0.6.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.592073" lon="-106.916830"><name>Way out: Left onto Ohio Creek Road</name><desc>Mile 3.5. Ohio Pass closed? CO 135 to Crested Butte, 24 mi.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.868419" lon="-106.984178"><name>Lunch: Crested Butte</name><desc>Mile 57. Secret Stash, 303 Elk, pizza, 970-349-6245 (listings disagree on lunch); Teocalli Tamale, 311 Elk, 11 to 9, 970-349-2005; The Last Steep, 208 Elk, from 11, 970-349-7007. Coffee: Camp 4.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.867964" lon="-106.984178"><name>Fuel: Crested Butte. 110 miles to Gunnison</name><desc>Mile 57.2. Exxon.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.665116" lon="-106.846348"><name>Way out: Left onto Taylor River Road</name><desc>Mile 74.4. Done? Gunnison is 10 mi on.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.817766" lon="-106.561978"><name>Check: Onto Union Park Cutoff</name><desc>Mile 97.2. Taylor Park Trading Post has a pump on the map; its season is about mid-May to September or October, and fuel wasn't confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.814292" lon="-106.521001"><name>Way out: DECIDE: Cumberland Pass Road</name><desc>Mile 99.6. Closed, storming or low? Back down Taylor River: Gunnison 33 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.612273" lon="-106.506979"><name>Way out: Pitkin</name><desc>Mile 123.6. Tired? CR 76 to Parlin and US 50: Gunnison 27 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.544393" lon="-106.924988"><name>Fuel: Sinclair</name><desc>Mile 167.2.</desc></wpt>
